<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.71.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price 99.71.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.3 trillion yen of six-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Thursday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.71  Stop rate     0.576 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.712  Average yield 0.571 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   2.81501  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.29983  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 85.8702 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 June 10, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity    December 10, 1997</p>
